WEBVTT

1
01:07:33.706 --> 01:07:38.706
Lord, clothe us in your power this morning. This Word must continue in power.

2
01:07:40.706 --> 01:07:42.706
It must continue with power.

3
01:07:58.706 --> 01:08:01.706
Lord, we need that new wind.

4
01:08:03.706 --> 01:08:05.706
We need a new change.

5
01:08:07.706 --> 01:08:09.706
Lord, break the mold of us.

6
01:08:11.706 --> 01:08:13.706
New understanding of why we come together.

7
01:08:13.706 --> 01:08:35.706
I am a warrior and I fight for God to do His work this morning.

8
01:08:43.706 --> 01:08:49.706
No, no, no, to change the atmosphere, for the Holy Spirit to come with power. Come on.

9
01:08:56.706 --> 01:08:59.706
To bring me through the Word I need to sing a little. No, come on.

10
01:08:59.706 --> 01:09:04.706
I need faith. I have a spirit of talk. I need a spirit.

11
01:09:05.706 --> 01:09:08.706
I need a fresh anointing. Amen.

12
01:09:13.706 --> 01:09:19.706
And I know that in my bones I was made for such a moment as this. Do you feel that in your bones?

13
01:09:19.706 --> 01:09:23.706
You were made for such a moment as this.

14
01:09:29.706 --> 01:09:34.706
Not to shrink back in fear, but the spirit of power, love, and a sound mind.

15
01:09:34.706 --> 01:09:41.706
The spirit of God moves against the times of culture. Come on.

16
01:09:43.706 --> 01:09:52.706
Not to shrink back in fear, but to have that spirit of God, that spirit of love, of power, and of a sound mind to go against the culture.

17
01:09:58.706 --> 01:10:02.706
And I speak to your spirit. Wake that fight up.

18
01:10:14.706 --> 01:10:24.706
And I really want to encourage you day by day. You need more, so retreat and turn on that worship and be in His presence.

19
01:10:24.706 --> 01:10:27.706
From front to back. I exclude no one. I include myself.

20
01:10:27.706 --> 01:10:33.706
The Lord said to me, you think you have something. You need more. I said, okay, I need even more.

21
01:10:33.706 --> 01:10:36.706
More oversight, more of His clothing and strength. Come on.

22
01:10:46.706 --> 01:10:51.706
You already have something. But you don't know what is coming, Vanessa.

23
01:10:51.706 --> 01:10:58.706
And you must be deeply rooted. And it is so important to be clothed with another spirit. And that is the spirit of God.

24
01:11:02.706 --> 01:11:04.706
Fire has come upon us.

25
01:11:06.706 --> 01:11:08.706
The fear of the Lord is returning.

26
01:11:10.706 --> 01:11:12.706
Come on, Monday-like.

27
01:11:12.706 --> 01:11:14.706
On Sunday you told your wife, on Monday we must be here.

28
01:11:19.706 --> 01:11:21.706
For you had a breakthrough with the Lord.

29
01:11:25.706 --> 01:11:27.706
You had a breakthrough with the Lord.

30
01:11:31.706 --> 01:11:33.706
You had a breakthrough with the Lord.

31
01:11:37.706 --> 01:11:39.706
You had a breakthrough with the Lord.

32
01:11:43.706 --> 01:11:45.706
What happened on Monday?

33
01:11:51.706 --> 01:11:53.706
That breakthrough was there.

34
01:11:54.706 --> 01:11:56.706
Let's honor the Lord for that.

35
01:12:00.706 --> 01:12:02.706
It is all worth it.

36
01:12:03.706 --> 01:12:05.706
And He has held you fast.

37
01:12:05.706 --> 01:12:07.706
Both of you.

38
01:12:08.706 --> 01:12:10.706
And He wants to hold your life.

39
01:12:11.706 --> 01:12:13.706
And I truly believe that He has marked you.

40
01:12:17.706 --> 01:12:19.706
And you have had a difficult time.

41
01:12:22.706 --> 01:12:24.706
But this is the moment and there is no turning back.

42
01:12:27.706 --> 01:12:29.706
But I can see it in you, that you know it.

43
01:12:29.706 --> 01:12:31.706
And that you know where you need to be.

44
01:12:36.706 --> 01:12:38.706
Can we together...

45
01:12:39.706 --> 01:12:41.706
Can we together pray for Him, because I feel it so strongly.

46
01:12:41.706 --> 01:12:43.706
You are made for this moment to be here.

47
01:12:46.706 --> 01:12:48.706
We surround you with the power of God.

48
01:12:53.706 --> 01:12:55.706
That the Holy Spirit grabs hold of you like never before.

49
01:13:00.706 --> 01:13:04.706
That you both understand that you are made and sent for a time such as this.

50
01:13:08.706 --> 01:13:11.706
And whatever has been, that is washed by the blood of Jesus.

51
01:13:15.706 --> 01:13:18.706
Washed and ready, forgiven and clean.

52
01:13:19.706 --> 01:13:21.706
It is a new day.

53
01:13:22.706 --> 01:13:24.706
Come with me, says the Lord.

54
01:13:28.706 --> 01:13:31.706
Come with me in the power of my Spirit and I will show you the way.

55
01:13:32.706 --> 01:13:33.706
Do not be afraid.

56
01:13:34.706 --> 01:13:36.706
Go all in.

57
01:13:36.706 --> 01:13:37.706
In Jesus' name.

58
01:13:38.706 --> 01:13:39.706
We bless you.

59
01:13:40.706 --> 01:13:41.706
Amen.

60
01:13:41.706 --> 01:13:43.706
The Lord sets people free.

61
01:13:46.706 --> 01:13:47.706
He marks us.

62
01:13:49.706 --> 01:13:51.706
And yes, we prayed on Monday.

63
01:13:53.706 --> 01:13:56.706
It changed and we went to this intercession.

64
01:13:57.706 --> 01:13:58.706
And we had to cry.

65
01:14:06.706 --> 01:14:08.706
That the glory of God will increase.

66
01:14:11.706 --> 01:14:13.706
Sin will be hard to remain in.

67
01:14:15.706 --> 01:14:17.706
It will be difficult to be compromised.

68
01:14:20.706 --> 01:14:22.706
It will be easy to enter the glory of God.

69
01:14:26.706 --> 01:14:28.706
Sin is left at the altar.

70
01:14:36.706 --> 01:14:37.706
We must give everything.

71
01:14:41.706 --> 01:14:42.706
We must give everything.

72
01:14:44.706 --> 01:14:45.706
For the fire of God is coming.

73
01:14:46.706 --> 01:14:47.706
It is here.

74
01:14:47.706 --> 01:14:48.706
It is becoming intense.

75
01:14:52.706 --> 01:14:55.706
And I want to speak about this today, because I want to give understanding.

76
01:14:56.706 --> 01:14:59.706
And I want to speak about this today, because I want us to understand what is happening.

77
01:15:08.706 --> 01:15:11.706
I want to explain what is happening now.

78
01:15:22.706 --> 01:15:23.706
So Lord, help us.

79
01:15:23.706 --> 01:15:24.706
Help us as a body.

80
01:15:24.706 --> 01:15:26.706
Help me to see what is happening.

81
01:15:26.706 --> 01:15:28.706
And give that revelation.

82
01:15:34.706 --> 01:15:37.706
If you are new in this house, then I want to welcome you.

83
01:15:37.706 --> 01:15:39.706
And immediately say, it is time to give everything.

84
01:15:39.706 --> 01:15:42.706
I want, I don't know, I haven't spoken this with you, but I know you are the same.

85
01:15:43.706 --> 01:15:44.706
I want a pastor.

86
01:15:45.706 --> 01:15:48.706
Not a settled church, but a church that is on fire.

87
01:15:55.706 --> 01:15:57.706
That will change with the season and with the Lord.

88
01:16:01.706 --> 01:16:03.706
That will invite the glory of God.

89
01:16:04.706 --> 01:16:09.706
And that will do everything necessary, both personally and as a whole, to see that He comes.

90
01:16:15.706 --> 01:16:16.706
There I am.

91
01:16:19.706 --> 01:16:21.706
That is time, and I have the leadership there once.

92
01:16:22.706 --> 01:16:23.706
There I am.

93
01:16:28.706 --> 01:16:30.706
That is time, and I have the leadership there once.

94
01:16:34.706 --> 01:16:35.706
You are already in.

95
01:16:51.706 --> 01:16:54.706
The Lord said that already in 2020, in His way, it is only in His way.

96
01:17:06.706 --> 01:17:09.706
And that spoke globally to the whole body of Christ.

97
01:17:13.706 --> 01:17:14.706
He is not playing games.

98
01:17:15.706 --> 01:17:16.706
He has a plan.

99
01:17:18.706 --> 01:17:19.706
And that plan did not end at the cross.

100
01:17:22.706 --> 01:17:26.706
We understand that He still has something to perfect, to finish.

101
01:17:32.706 --> 01:17:33.706
And He is full of passion about it.

102
01:17:36.706 --> 01:17:38.706
He is full of passion and fire for His people.

103
01:17:42.706 --> 01:17:44.706
He is full of passion for us.

104
01:17:48.706 --> 01:17:50.706
He is full of passion for those who are lost.

105
01:17:52.706 --> 01:17:53.706
And He knows that He will return.

106
01:17:57.706 --> 01:17:59.706
He does not know when, the Bible only says the Father knows that.

107
01:18:01.706 --> 01:18:02.706
But He knows it.

108
01:18:03.706 --> 01:18:04.706
There will come a moment.

109
01:18:06.706 --> 01:18:07.706
When I will meet my bride.

110
01:18:09.706 --> 01:18:11.706
And she will be ready to meet me.

111
01:18:15.706 --> 01:18:16.706
She will have prepared herself.

112
01:18:22.706 --> 01:18:23.706
Not in her own strength.

113
01:18:25.706 --> 01:18:26.706
She will do it with the Spirit.

114
01:18:27.706 --> 01:18:29.706
But she will prepare for the moment when the Spirit says to do so.

115
01:18:34.706 --> 01:18:35.706
He comes for a bride that is ready.

116
01:18:38.706 --> 01:18:39.706
A bride that longs for Him.

117
01:18:41.706 --> 01:18:42.706
A people that longs for Him.

118
01:18:52.706 --> 01:18:56.706
What I want to speak about today is that preparation we are already in the midst of.

119
01:19:00.706 --> 01:19:02.706
That there is a sifting taking place.

120
01:19:06.706 --> 01:19:08.706
The Bible speaks about how the Lord sifts.

121
01:19:13.706 --> 01:19:17.706
And I felt that He says the sifting is to bring about a change.

122
01:19:22.706 --> 01:19:26.706
That sifting takes place in the body of Christ so that we can make that change.

123
01:19:32.706 --> 01:19:35.706
And we will read from Luke 12, but that sifting is important.

124
01:19:40.706 --> 01:19:42.706
There is a fire and that fire has a purpose.

125
01:19:43.706 --> 01:19:46.706
And I believe that it has everything to do with the sifting that the Lord does.

126
01:19:52.706 --> 01:19:54.706
So we begin in Luke 12, around verse 35.

127
01:20:04.706 --> 01:20:05.706
But what is that sifting?

128
01:20:06.706 --> 01:20:08.706
But what I want to say is that sifting...

129
01:20:09.706 --> 01:20:10.706
What is sifting?

130
01:20:12.706 --> 01:20:13.706
Sifting is when you...

131
01:20:15.706 --> 01:20:18.706
You put something, a substance, through a sieve.

132
01:20:20.706 --> 01:20:23.706
You put it through a sifter and that loses the impurities.

133
01:20:24.706 --> 01:20:25.706
That loses the lumps.

134
01:20:26.706 --> 01:20:29.706
Sifting is like when you pass a substance through a sieve.

135
01:20:31.706 --> 01:20:34.706
And what that does is it changes the imperfections and the lumps.

136
01:20:36.706 --> 01:20:38.706
You start to break down the contents.

137
01:20:47.706 --> 01:20:49.706
So that what is pure remains.

138
01:20:52.706 --> 01:20:53.706
Have you ever sifted flour?

139
01:20:57.706 --> 01:21:01.706
And all the lumps remain and you only keep the loose flour.

140
01:21:06.706 --> 01:21:10.706
But it goes through those very small holes of the sieve, so that only what is pure remains.

141
01:21:20.706 --> 01:21:22.706
And you are left with what is pure.

142
01:21:23.706 --> 01:21:24.706
And we have also sung that.

143
01:21:25.706 --> 01:21:27.706
The Lord refines with His fire.

144
01:21:31.706 --> 01:21:33.706
And when God begins to sift His people...

145
01:21:36.706 --> 01:21:38.706
...then He looks at what is inside us.

146
01:21:47.706 --> 01:21:50.706
And I am not talking about salvation this morning. I hope you understand that.

147
01:21:50.706 --> 01:21:52.706
But He sifts His people, His nation.

148
01:21:58.706 --> 01:22:02.706
I speak to us as kingdom people, as people of God.

149
01:22:05.706 --> 01:22:07.706
He examines what is within you.

150
01:22:16.706 --> 01:22:18.706
And as a house, He examines what is inside us.

151
01:22:25.706 --> 01:22:27.706
What can this place hold?

152
01:22:28.706 --> 01:22:31.706
What can we carry, bear as a body?

153
01:22:40.706 --> 01:22:42.706
When He pours out His Spirit.

154
01:22:46.706 --> 01:22:49.706
When He pours out a greater measure of glory and power.

155
01:22:53.706 --> 01:22:55.706
He does not do that just once.

156
01:22:56.706 --> 01:22:57.706
There is a process.

157
01:23:02.706 --> 01:23:08.706
For God does not treat His most precious possession lightly.

158
01:23:18.706 --> 01:23:20.706
And He treats us with love.

159
01:23:20.706 --> 01:23:22.706
And He is gentle with us.

160
01:23:23.706 --> 01:23:27.706
And He wants to pour nothing over us that we cannot handle.

161
01:23:35.706 --> 01:23:39.706
And the reality is that there is a purity needed in us.

162
01:23:52.706 --> 01:23:57.706
So year after year and moment by moment, the Lord looks and observes.

163
01:23:57.706 --> 01:24:02.706
And he sees how we react and what answer we give.

164
01:24:04.706 --> 01:24:06.706
How do they respond to my Word?

165
01:24:07.706 --> 01:24:12.706
Not only to the word that is spoken, but also how do they respond to me?

166
01:24:12.706 --> 01:24:15.706
Is there obedience or is there reluctance?

167
01:24:28.706 --> 01:24:29.706
Is there surrender?

168
01:24:31.706 --> 01:24:33.706
Is there giving him the first place?

169
01:24:37.706 --> 01:24:41.706
Or is there resistance or is there reluctance?

170
01:24:52.706 --> 01:24:57.706
For depending on what he finds, that determines the measure and how he can use us.

171
01:24:58.706 --> 01:24:59.706
And that is logical.

172
01:25:00.706 --> 01:25:05.706
If I were to give Joshua the keys to our car now, he would not be able to handle it.

173
01:25:13.706 --> 01:25:15.706
That would be very irresponsible of me.

174
01:25:17.706 --> 01:25:19.706
And do you know that God works in the same way?

175
01:25:19.706 --> 01:25:29.706
I am talking about us individually as well as us as a body as a whole.

176
01:25:29.706 --> 01:25:31.706
He gives us nothing.

177
01:25:38.706 --> 01:25:43.706
He will not give you something that is more than you can handle.

178
01:25:43.706 --> 01:25:48.706
He will not give you something if he knows in advance that he will destroy instead of bless.

179
01:25:49.706 --> 01:25:54.706
He speaks in these last years about what is in my body.

180
01:25:54.706 --> 01:25:57.706
He does not speak about the unexpected, he speaks about the church.

181
01:25:57.706 --> 01:26:02.706
He says what comes out of the thick spaces.

182
01:26:13.706 --> 01:26:15.706
The Word speaks about what the Lord observes.

183
01:26:20.706 --> 01:26:21.706
He says that in the prophets.

184
01:26:28.706 --> 01:26:32.706
He looks and he sees how we react, how we live for him.

185
01:26:37.706 --> 01:26:40.706
And I believe that 2022 is a turning point.

186
01:26:42.706 --> 01:26:44.706
It is a point of change.

187
01:26:50.706 --> 01:27:08.706
And many of us feel that turning point, that we look from if I am not fully in it now, where do I stand?

188
01:27:09.706 --> 01:27:14.706
Another way to say it is to set some things aside.

189
01:27:14.706 --> 01:27:17.706
God settles some accounts with us. Amen?

190
01:27:21.706 --> 01:27:23.706
He settles accounts.

191
01:27:24.706 --> 01:27:26.706
I don't know how else to say it.

192
01:27:30.706 --> 01:27:33.706
He says, okay, this is where it is.

193
01:27:33.706 --> 01:27:36.706
This is real, but I know it can be a bit intense for us.

194
01:27:36.706 --> 01:27:38.706
I understand that, but it is real.

195
01:27:38.706 --> 01:27:44.706
He looks at Trudy's life and he says, okay, by 2022, this is where we are.

196
01:27:44.706 --> 01:27:48.706
This is what I can give, this is what I can give to her.

197
01:27:48.706 --> 01:27:50.706
That's what I mean.

198
01:27:50.706 --> 01:27:52.706
It sounds very intense, but it is the reality.

199
01:27:52.706 --> 01:27:59.706
God looks at a life and says, okay, it is now 2022, where do you stand?

200
01:27:59.706 --> 01:28:01.706
What can I give you?

201
01:28:05.706 --> 01:28:08.706
For the answer in my spirit, that is important.

202
01:28:13.706 --> 01:28:18.706
The answer of my life towards the Lord, that is important, that is what it all revolves around.

203
01:28:21.706 --> 01:28:29.706
I am not talking about salvation. Salvation is a gift, but what do you do with that gift afterwards?

204
01:28:31.706 --> 01:28:33.706
What do you do with the rest of it?

205
01:28:34.706 --> 01:28:36.706
Do you hold it back from the Lord?

206
01:28:39.706 --> 01:28:43.706
Or do you say, I need to go all in, I need to fully commit to it.

207
01:28:50.706 --> 01:28:52.706
And that sifting, that has a purpose.

208
01:28:58.706 --> 01:29:02.706
The sifting leads to that shift, to where He wants to go.

209
01:29:03.706 --> 01:29:20.706
And we are being prepared, as we have also talked about in Joel 1 and 2, the preparation is so that He can give a greater outpouring of His spirit.

210
01:29:23.706 --> 01:29:26.706
And that greater glory, that also has a purpose.

211
01:29:33.706 --> 01:29:47.706
And then we return to Isaiah, where it says, in the days of darkness I will pour out my glory over my people, so that there will be a great harvest.

212
01:29:48.706 --> 01:30:02.706
For He is good, and He says when it is dark, then I am the light and I will appear brightly and people will know where they need to be.

213
01:30:05.706 --> 01:30:07.706
But I need a people that is ready for that.

214
01:30:10.706 --> 01:30:13.706
I need a people that is ready to go with me in that.

215
01:30:18.706 --> 01:30:26.706
So He needs to shake us awake and take us out of that form of known church and put us into a kingdom form.

216
01:30:30.706 --> 01:30:32.706
He comes to establish His kingdom.

217
01:30:32.706 --> 01:30:38.706
And the church is just a foretaste of the kingdom. The kingdom is you and I following the King.

218
01:30:42.706 --> 01:30:44.706
The church is not the end goal.

219
01:30:49.706 --> 01:30:51.706
This is a foretaste of the kingdom on earth.

220
01:30:51.706 --> 01:30:56.706
This is where the lost come in and get a foretaste and they say what is this place? This place is different.

221
01:31:01.706 --> 01:31:05.706
It is where darkness is driven out, for the light shines through the darkness outward.

222
01:31:10.706 --> 01:31:12.706
It is a foretaste of the kingdom on earth.

223
01:31:12.706 --> 01:31:14.706
And they say, what is this place? This place is different.

224
01:31:18.706 --> 01:31:21.706
It is where darkness is driven out, for the light shines brighter.

225
01:31:23.706 --> 01:31:25.706
But do we want his presence?

226
01:31:26.706 --> 01:31:27.706
But we cannot do it.

227
01:31:29.706 --> 01:31:32.706
Without him, gathering has no meaning.

228
01:31:32.706 --> 01:31:37.706
So he asks, do you want to be a people that runs with me? Do you want me to move among you in power or do you just want to sit back?

229
01:31:50.706 --> 01:31:52.706
He comes where he is desired.

230
01:32:02.706 --> 01:32:07.706
Where we have purified ourselves, where we have put away things of the world and where we say I am an instrument for your glory.

231
01:32:18.706 --> 01:32:20.706
I am a sign of the kingdom.

232
01:32:23.706 --> 01:32:26.706
I am a testimony for the king and his kingdom.

233
01:32:33.706 --> 01:32:38.706
I am a representative of all that the king can do, of freeing, of removing sins, of being released from occultism.

234
01:32:49.706 --> 01:32:51.706
I am a living example of that.

235
01:32:53.706 --> 01:32:56.706
But what happens when a body is in conflict?

236
01:32:59.706 --> 01:33:01.706
What happens when you are divided?

237
01:33:03.706 --> 01:33:06.706
What happens when the body of Christ lives in sin?

238
01:33:11.706 --> 01:33:17.706
What happens when the body of Christ relaxes and just goes along with all cultural desires?

239
01:33:22.706 --> 01:33:28.706
What happens when the body of Christ does not recognize the urgency of the time we live in?

240
01:33:33.706 --> 01:33:35.706
What happens when you do not want to praise him?

241
01:33:36.706 --> 01:33:38.706
What happens if you do not want to pray?

242
01:33:39.706 --> 01:33:41.706
Then there is no glory.

243
01:33:45.706 --> 01:33:49.706
For you cannot pour out glory on a body that is divided.

244
01:33:51.706 --> 01:33:53.706
Then you will break under it.

245
01:33:55.706 --> 01:33:57.706
It reveals what is inside.

246
01:34:02.706 --> 01:34:04.706
He really wants to teach things.

247
01:34:12.706 --> 01:34:16.706
So he is sifting and he is removing the compromises.

248
01:34:20.706 --> 01:34:22.706
He says step fully in with me.

249
01:34:24.706 --> 01:34:25.706
For I am coming.

250
01:34:27.706 --> 01:34:29.706
And I want to work with my bride.

251
01:34:33.706 --> 01:34:41.706
So that sifting is so that change can come, so that outpouring can come, so that the harvest can come.

252
01:34:44.706 --> 01:34:46.706
He longs for that harvest.

253
01:34:47.706 --> 01:34:54.706
Do you know that it says in the gospel that the good news will be preached to every nation as a testimony for him?

254
01:35:07.706 --> 01:35:10.706
The gospel will go out to every place.

255
01:35:13.706 --> 01:35:15.706
And many will be saved through it.

256
01:35:17.706 --> 01:35:19.706
Many will also reject it.

257
01:35:24.706 --> 01:35:30.706
We do not believe in a universalism that everyone will be saved. There are people who reject Jesus.

258
01:35:31.706 --> 01:35:33.706
He has done everything.

259
01:35:37.706 --> 01:35:40.706
And it requires a choice. It requires a yes Lord.

260
01:35:41.706 --> 01:35:44.706
And when that has happened, then the end will come.

261
01:35:50.706 --> 01:35:53.706
And that end is the time that will change.

262
01:35:56.706 --> 01:35:58.706
It is no longer this century.

263
01:36:01.706 --> 01:36:03.706
We are changing from era.

264
01:36:04.706 --> 01:36:07.706
Then we will be under the reign of the king.

265
01:36:11.706 --> 01:36:13.706
Then there is a change.

266
01:36:17.706 --> 01:36:19.706
And then the accounts will truly be settled.

267
01:36:24.706 --> 01:36:28.706
So that glory that is to come and that harvest is so important.

268
01:36:33.706 --> 01:36:35.706
That is so important.

269
01:36:35.706 --> 01:36:37.706
When that moment happens.

270
01:36:41.706 --> 01:36:43.706
And he wants to be part of it.

271
01:36:43.706 --> 01:36:45.706
And he wants to be part of it.

272
01:36:45.706 --> 01:36:47.706
Nations and times and language.

273
01:36:47.706 --> 01:36:49.706
And people who have not yet heard.

274
01:36:49.706 --> 01:36:50.706
But they will hear.

275
01:36:50.706 --> 01:36:51.706
And they will come in.

276
01:36:51.706 --> 01:36:53.706
And they need something to come in.

277
01:36:54.706 --> 01:36:57.706
And lands, nations, languages, peoples.

278
01:36:57.706 --> 01:36:59.706
They will come in.

279
01:36:59.706 --> 01:37:02.706
And they need something in which they can come in.

280
01:37:04.706 --> 01:37:07.706
They need something to be able to come in.

281
01:37:08.706 --> 01:37:10.706
They need the kingdom.

282
01:37:10.706 --> 01:37:12.706
They need the people of God.

283
01:37:13.706 --> 01:37:15.706
Ready to teach them.

284
01:37:15.706 --> 01:37:17.706
Filled with the glory of God.

285
01:37:17.706 --> 01:37:19.706
Filled with the spirit of Christ.

286
01:37:23.706 --> 01:37:25.706
Do not be afraid of what comes in.

287
01:37:28.706 --> 01:37:30.706
But know how to cast out those demons.

288
01:37:32.706 --> 01:37:34.706
That is a new level of glory.

289
01:37:36.706 --> 01:37:38.706
It does not work, once again, in my strength.

290
01:37:38.706 --> 01:37:40.706
But it is filled with the spirit.

291
01:37:40.706 --> 01:37:43.706
To the point that the darkness must be cast out.

292
01:37:45.706 --> 01:37:47.706
It is not acting in my own strength.

293
01:37:47.706 --> 01:37:49.706
But it is being so filled with the spirit.

294
01:37:49.706 --> 01:37:52.706
That the darkness cannot help but be cast out.

295
01:37:56.706 --> 01:37:59.706
He wants us to make people and nations into disciples.

296
01:38:02.706 --> 01:38:03.706
And this is the great story.

297
01:38:03.706 --> 01:38:05.706
I understand that we have small lives.

298
01:38:05.706 --> 01:38:07.706
And daily life is such a...

299
01:38:11.706 --> 01:38:14.706
But this is the great, beautiful storyline that we are part of.

300
01:38:25.706 --> 01:38:28.706
But I believe that if you are transported to that story...

301
01:38:28.706 --> 01:38:30.706
life becomes easier.

302
01:38:34.706 --> 01:38:36.706
For I am part of a larger story.

303
01:38:36.706 --> 01:38:38.706
I am part of something eternal.

304
01:38:43.706 --> 01:38:46.706
And he is really very serious about finishing that.

305
01:38:54.706 --> 01:38:56.706
Let's read a passage from Luke.

306
01:39:03.706 --> 01:39:04.706
Okay, I will start.

307
01:39:04.706 --> 01:39:07.706
There is a lot here, so I will see what I can explain.

308
01:39:12.706 --> 01:39:14.706
And he is speaking here to the disciples.

309
01:39:14.706 --> 01:39:16.706
He says, be ready, gird your loins.

310
01:39:18.706 --> 01:39:20.706
He is speaking to us, right?

311
01:39:20.706 --> 01:39:22.706
Keep the lamps burning.

312
01:39:24.706 --> 01:39:27.706
We must burn, we must be alive with the Spirit.

313
01:39:28.706 --> 01:39:32.706
And it is the same image again as the girls and the oil.

314
01:39:39.706 --> 01:39:42.706
And be like servants who wait for their lord.

315
01:39:45.706 --> 01:39:47.706
When he returns from a wedding.

316
01:39:49.706 --> 01:39:51.706
So that when he knocks...

317
01:39:53.706 --> 01:39:54.706
And knocks.

318
01:39:58.706 --> 01:40:00.706
They can immediately open the door for him.

319
01:40:05.706 --> 01:40:08.706
We want to be people who have a quick response time.

320
01:40:13.706 --> 01:40:16.706
That he says, okay, I can easily come in there.

321
01:40:18.706 --> 01:40:19.706
There is no resistance.

322
01:40:22.706 --> 01:40:23.706
There is no pushing back.

323
01:40:28.706 --> 01:40:31.706
He says that if I come, that if I change the gear...

324
01:40:31.706 --> 01:40:34.706
that it will go easily, because they have been waiting for me.

325
01:40:39.706 --> 01:40:43.706
Blessed are the servants whom the Lord finds awake at his coming.

326
01:40:44.706 --> 01:40:47.706
And I understand that this also speaks about when he comes.

327
01:40:47.706 --> 01:40:50.706
But it is also for now that he is looking for a bride...

328
01:40:50.706 --> 01:40:53.706
who can go along when he changes the gear.

329
01:40:54.706 --> 01:40:58.706
In other words, is this for the great crowd or for the disciples?

330
01:41:03.706 --> 01:41:08.706
If you ask Jesus, give me the words that you mean for the great crowd and the disciples.

331
01:41:12.706 --> 01:41:14.706
And then I say, I have understanding.

332
01:41:17.706 --> 01:41:19.706
And then I say, I have understanding.

333
01:41:20.706 --> 01:41:23.706
If you ask Jesus, give me the words...

334
01:41:23.706 --> 01:41:26.706
then he will speak more directly with you, because you are following him.

335
01:41:32.706 --> 01:41:36.706
The Lord answered, who then is the faithful and wise steward?

336
01:41:40.706 --> 01:41:46.706
Whom the Lord will appoint over his servants to give them their food at the proper time.

337
01:41:50.706 --> 01:41:55.706
It will be good for that servant whom the Lord finds doing so when he returns.

338
01:41:59.706 --> 01:42:04.706
Truly, I tell you, he will put him in charge of all his possessions.

339
01:42:04.706 --> 01:42:05.706
This is the sifting.

340
01:42:05.706 --> 01:42:08.706
He says, what is in them? What are they doing?

341
01:42:08.706 --> 01:42:10.706
While they wait, what do they do?

342
01:42:20.706 --> 01:42:22.706
And what does he do?

343
01:42:22.706 --> 01:42:24.706
He rewards.

344
01:42:36.706 --> 01:42:40.706
He gives rewards. He says, okay, are you doing what I asked of you?

345
01:42:40.706 --> 01:42:44.706
Then I will give you more and I will reward you in a powerful way.

346
01:42:50.706 --> 01:42:55.706
But if that servant says to himself, in her heart, in her attitude.

347
01:42:58.706 --> 01:43:00.706
My lord is taking a long time to come.

348
01:43:05.706 --> 01:43:08.706
And if he starts to beat the other servants and maidservants.

349
01:43:10.706 --> 01:43:12.706
Acts out and behaves badly.

350
01:43:13.706 --> 01:43:15.706
The culture in which we live.

351
01:43:20.706 --> 01:43:23.706
Then the lord of that servant will come on a day when he does not expect it.

352
01:43:25.706 --> 01:43:27.706
He has not waited in the right way.

353
01:43:28.706 --> 01:43:29.706
Do you see that?

354
01:43:42.706 --> 01:43:47.706
The attitude of that person is, well, we'll see, and if it happens, then I'll jump in.

355
01:43:47.706 --> 01:43:48.706
Then it will be too late.

356
01:43:50.706 --> 01:43:52.706
I have time to still do what I want.

357
01:44:02.706 --> 01:44:06.706
If you think, I still have time to enjoy what is happening in the world.

358
01:44:06.706 --> 01:44:08.706
There is no time.

359
01:44:09.706 --> 01:44:11.706
You will be surprised when I come.

360
01:44:18.706 --> 01:44:23.706
There will come a moment when he is not aware of me and has become blind.

361
01:44:31.706 --> 01:44:35.706
Okay, and that person will be assigned a place among the unbelievers.

362
01:44:38.706 --> 01:44:39.706
And that is the seven.

363
01:44:42.706 --> 01:44:45.706
It really matters how we respond.

364
01:44:48.706 --> 01:44:57.706
For when He begins to sift us, we will find ourselves on one side of the coin.

365
01:45:00.706 --> 01:45:02.706
In verse 49, He then says.

366
01:45:08.706 --> 01:45:11.706
I have come to cast fire on the earth.

367
01:45:12.706 --> 01:45:15.706
And how I wish it were already kindled.

368
01:45:22.706 --> 01:45:24.706
He wants to give a baptism of fire.

369
01:45:31.706 --> 01:45:34.706
But when that comes, it will bring division.

370
01:45:35.706 --> 01:45:38.706
What is inside will become visible.

371
01:45:52.706 --> 01:45:56.706
It will not always bring peace and unity in the way you think.

372
01:45:56.706 --> 01:46:05.706
But it will cause division because it shows who can bear what.

373
01:46:10.706 --> 01:46:16.706
And this is true for believers versus unbelievers, but it also plays out within the body.

374
01:46:21.706 --> 01:46:23.706
That baptism of fire does two things.

375
01:46:27.706 --> 01:46:33.706
Or it shows itself in two ways, depending on what is happening inside your heart.

376
01:46:41.706 --> 01:46:47.706
For those who surrender in obedience and in submission.

377
01:46:48.706 --> 01:46:52.706
And who seek to obey the management.

378
01:46:52.706 --> 01:46:55.706
Not perfectly, but with a seeking heart.

379
01:47:00.706 --> 01:47:04.706
When that measure of fire comes, it is intense, but it is full of glory.

380
01:47:05.706 --> 01:47:11.706
Although it makes you more dead to yourself, you still long for it even more.

381
01:47:14.706 --> 01:47:15.706
It is intense.

382
01:47:18.706 --> 01:47:22.706
It purifies you seven times in the way you do it.

383
01:47:27.706 --> 01:47:28.706
It is intense.

384
01:47:29.706 --> 01:47:32.706
It purifies you seven times again.

385
01:47:36.706 --> 01:47:38.706
But it is full of glory.

386
01:47:41.706 --> 01:47:43.706
And you really want it and you want more of Him.

387
01:47:46.706 --> 01:47:48.706
And the other side of the coin.

388
01:47:51.706 --> 01:47:55.706
And this applies to everything, this also applies when the Word is spoken.

389
01:47:59.706 --> 01:48:01.706
It becomes a point of decision.

390
01:48:02.706 --> 01:48:06.706
The other side is that it is a judgment and that it becomes a point of decision.

391
01:48:14.706 --> 01:48:19.706
And then it is not an intensity that is full of glory but then it becomes unbearable.

392
01:48:23.706 --> 01:48:26.706
It feels uncomfortable but in a way that you do not want at all.

393
01:48:28.706 --> 01:48:30.706
And then there is resistance.

394
01:48:37.706 --> 01:48:42.706
And what I want to say is that such a baptism of fire, it is here and it is coming.

395
01:48:45.706 --> 01:48:48.706
It is here, it works and it is becoming more intense.

396
01:48:48.706 --> 01:48:51.706
Some of you already recognize it, some of you are already in it.

397
01:48:51.706 --> 01:48:56.706
And for the people who want it, it becomes intense but glorious.

398
01:48:56.706 --> 01:48:57.706
You want more.

399
01:49:06.706 --> 01:49:14.706
If you have resisted the work of the Lord up to now.

400
01:49:19.706 --> 01:49:22.706
Then the fire brings that to light again.

401
01:49:36.706 --> 01:49:41.706
And then there is again that possibility to tear open your heart and say, here I am.

402
01:49:41.706 --> 01:49:46.706
I did not see it, I did not know it, I held back your steps but here I am.

403
01:49:49.706 --> 01:49:53.706
There is a possibility but it is real and you must choose it.

404
01:49:57.706 --> 01:49:58.706
Do you recognize that?

405
01:50:02.706 --> 01:50:07.706
And when that comes, it brings a kind of division, separation.

406
01:50:12.706 --> 01:50:16.706
But it is God who brings that division and it is His work.

407
01:50:19.706 --> 01:50:23.706
It is for His glory and for what He desires to do.

408
01:50:26.706 --> 01:50:33.706
And this is where we have been and where we are going.

409
01:50:37.706 --> 01:50:40.706
And I want to invite us to stand.

410
01:50:41.706 --> 01:50:48.706
For when you begin to feel this, it is not just something, it is very real.

411
01:50:54.706 --> 01:50:57.706
So I want to pray and ask the Lord to continue His work.

412
01:51:00.706 --> 01:51:05.706
And when you begin to feel this, it is not just something, it is very real.

413
01:51:10.706 --> 01:51:24.706
And I want to say that if you find yourself on the resistant side, if you find yourself in compromise, you still need to open yourself in a greater and deeper way, then do it today.

414
01:51:25.706 --> 01:51:27.706
There is a day that is called today.

415
01:51:28.706 --> 01:51:37.706
And if you have resisted, if you feel that there is still a surrender being asked of you, then do it today. There is a reason for today.

416
01:51:42.706 --> 01:51:44.706
Lord, we recognize your Spirit.

417
01:51:50.706 --> 01:51:54.706
It is not just for ourselves, but it is with an eye on your plan.

418
01:51:57.706 --> 01:52:07.706
And we recognize that you are very serious about this and that you truly desire to do this.

419
01:52:17.706 --> 01:52:22.706
And you are doing it in this house because you desire for us to walk with you and to run with you in that glory.

420
01:52:24.706 --> 01:52:25.706
It is real.

421
01:52:28.706 --> 01:52:30.706
Bring surrender.

422
01:52:34.706 --> 01:52:38.706
Where there is a divided heart, bring a wholeness of heart.

423
01:52:39.706 --> 01:52:47.706
Lord, where there are areas of sin, will you fill those places with hunger for you, with your Spirit.

424
01:52:53.706 --> 01:52:59.706
Lord, where there are areas of sin, will you fill those places with hunger for you, with your Spirit.

425
01:53:02.706 --> 01:53:03.706
There is something better for you.

426
01:53:04.706 --> 01:53:05.706
And that is called glory.

427
01:53:05.706 --> 01:53:07.706
That is called the presence of the Lord.

428
01:53:10.706 --> 01:53:11.706
That is called living with Him.

429
01:53:23.706 --> 01:53:32.706
And today I also want to say, if you do not yet know Jesus as your Redeemer, come forward and get to know Him, for today is the day of salvation.

430
01:53:33.706 --> 01:53:34.706
He is real.

431
01:53:40.706 --> 01:53:45.706
And He will forgive your sin and He will give you a new heart and He will give you a new desire for Him.

432
01:53:50.706 --> 01:53:52.706
And today He wants to fill you with His Spirit.

433
01:54:02.706 --> 01:54:10.706
And if you want someone to pray with you, to agree with you, that you want to break patterns and that you want to close things where you have made compromises, come as well.

434
01:54:12.706 --> 01:54:13.706
It is a day of freedom.

435
01:54:15.706 --> 01:54:17.706
It is a day of going for it with your whole heart.

436
01:54:19.706 --> 01:54:20.706
It is a day of surrender.

437
01:54:23.706 --> 01:54:25.706
And see how He fills you with His Spirit.

438
01:54:27.706 --> 01:54:29.706
If you need hunger for Him.

439
01:54:32.706 --> 01:54:34.706
If there are blockages, we want to pray those open.

440
01:54:41.706 --> 01:54:45.706
If you feel blocked and if you do not feel hunger for the Lord, we pray that open.

441
01:54:47.706 --> 01:54:48.706
Then I want to pray with you.

442
01:54:51.706 --> 01:54:53.706
You have to want it yourself, but then I would like to pray with you.

443
01:54:55.706 --> 01:54:56.706
Now is the moment.

444
01:54:59.706 --> 01:55:00.706
And the fire only gets more intense.

445
01:55:02.706 --> 01:55:03.706
There are only two sides.

446
01:55:09.706 --> 01:55:10.706
Lord, thank you for your Word.

447
01:55:14.706 --> 01:55:17.706
Thank you for your passion and for your fullness for us.

448
01:55:21.706 --> 01:55:24.706
Thank you that you love us, that you love your bride.

449
01:55:27.706 --> 01:55:29.706
And that there is so much goodness ahead of us.

450
01:55:30.706 --> 01:55:31.706
And we want it.

451
01:55:32.706 --> 01:55:33.706
I am going to ask a number of people to come forward.

452
01:55:34.706 --> 01:55:35.706
Hallelujah.

453
01:55:37.706 --> 01:55:39.706
If that is you, I want you to come to France tonight.

454
01:55:41.706 --> 01:55:42.706
If something else comes up.

455
01:56:02.706 --> 01:56:04.706
Faith in God is therefore serious in this.

456
01:56:05.706 --> 01:56:09.706
For God wants to pour out his spirit upon us, but he only does it to people who open their hearts.

457
01:56:10.706 --> 01:56:13.706
So come forward shortly, based on Vanessa's invitation.

458
01:56:14.706 --> 01:56:16.706
But Father in heaven, I thank you for this service.

459
01:56:17.706 --> 01:56:18.706
Lord, I thank you that you love us.

460
01:56:19.706 --> 01:56:22.706
Lord, I thank you that you will never give us what we cannot bear.

461
01:56:23.706 --> 01:56:25.706
Lord, but you want to give us more and more.

462
01:56:26.706 --> 01:56:31.706
And I send us into the week, together with the Holy Spirit, back to our family.

463
01:56:32.706 --> 01:56:35.706
To our families, to our jobs, to our schools.

464
01:56:36.706 --> 01:56:39.706
Lord, that we may be led by the Holy Spirit.

465
01:56:40.706 --> 01:56:42.706
And that we will always realize, Holy Spirit, that you are with us.

466
01:56:43.706 --> 01:56:44.706
Wherever we go.

467
01:56:45.706 --> 01:56:46.706
You are the God of 24/7.

468
01:56:47.706 --> 01:56:49.706
And I bless us for the coming week that we are about to face.

469
01:56:50.706 --> 01:56:51.706
In Jesus' name.

470
01:56:52.706 --> 01:56:53.706
And we all say amen.

471
01:56:54.706 --> 01:56:55.706
Amen and amen.

472
01:56:56.706 --> 01:56:57.706
I will see you all tomorrow.

473
01:56:58.706 --> 01:56:59.706
At the prayer evening.

474
01:57:00.706 --> 01:57:01.706
Bye bye.

475
